    "reviewer": "GoldenCheetah asset engineering and runtime integration audit",
    "reviewedAt": "2026-09-05",
    "notes": "Approved original low-poly rider and generic enduro 29er runtime asset. The integrated meshes retain the established axle, crank, steering, pelvis, shadow and camera pivots plus the snapshot-driven wheel, pedal, suspension and rider-pose animation contract. The model adds a readable open-face helmet, coherent fictional rider proportions, a generic long-travel full-suspension chassis, one-by drivetrain, platform pedals, fork arch, rear linkage and large unbranded black tires. No named bicycle design, person likeness, branded tread, logo, source mesh or proprietary surface is reproduced. No endorsement is claimed or implied. Deterministic Blender generation, two byte-identical Balsam conversions, packaged-resource loading and runtime rendering are required for release."
